(text "SIDE USB-C: INITIAL PROGRAMMING + RECOVERY" (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9f7135eb-7718-5b9e-9993-164319f55dbf"))
(text "USB 2.0 device; 5V input only. Side location is mandatory; exact PCB/enclosure placement remains open." (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e027fd24-bd5e-5560-ab4a-e75ad6866283"))
(text "FT232H HARDWARE BRIDGE" (at 208.28 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d1d13960-1e97-5e67-b10b-8e27a6e97e4e"))
(text "TARGET ISOLATION + SERVICE ACCESS" (at 373.38 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left top)) (uuid "417f4953-4b87-5d76-b8e2-7b66c6bd68c6"))
(text "TARGET_VREF comes from FPGA_3V3 (VCCIO8) through R414 on the FPGA sheet.\nIt powers the B-side translator; it is NOT a USB power output.\njtag_tck/tms/tdi/tdo go to the ECP5 dedicated JTAG balls (FPGA sheet).\nOnly one programmer may own JTAG at a time." (at 373.38 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cd865a15-0e07-524d-a59e-d364d6789da8"))
(text "DEFAULT DISABLED: R105 pulls /OE high. FTDI ACBUS6 is\ninput/pulled-up at blank startup. Host enters MPSSE first,\nthen enables the buffer with --status-pin 14.\nGeneric ft232 without that flag leaves the buffer disabled." (at 373.38 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0ce3d7a0-5c9c-5ba0-affa-38a6c8476bc1"))
(text "USB_3V3 powers this programmer and the power sheet TUSB320 (U301) only. No USB/host power tie.\nUSB_VBUS also feeds the power sheet default-off USB input (U302); R101/R102 DNP, U301 presents Rd.\nUSB suspend, inrush, ESD and power-off behavior require bench tests." (at 20.32 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f6e2ba67-cb7a-5662-a0a7-d25c90791ac5"))
(text "12MHz crystal replaces SC64 external oscillator.\n11pF caps are provisional: verify frequency/load after layout.\nOptional blank EEPROM: no main-FPGA firmware needed to enumerate." (at 177.8 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e03883cd-deea-53c7-9f45-0b1f9bd8eaf8"))
(text "SUPPORT PASSIVES (place at their associated IC/pin; electrical grouping here is not PCB placement)" (at 20.32 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c2e400d1-058b-53d1-88bc-b8453763058b"))
(text "DRAFT 0.2: USB programmer circuitry only. FPGA/storage choice, persistent-image map, system power, routing and physical validation are pending.\nSources: SummerCart64 a1e7996 (CERN-OHL-S-2.0), FTDI FT232H v2.2, TI SN74AXC4T774, JAE drawing SJ122205. See docs/design/usb-programming-architecture.md." (at 20.32 386.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "55316728-de5f-5b0d-b9a9-b3c0ae92ed7d"))
(sheet_instances (path "/e2505a21-9627-547b-aef4-ab0d2c57bd10/56555fbf-4808-59ed-83be-e09275d01434" (page "2"))) (embedded_fonts no))
